meta {
  name: Read what the plan page knows about this organization
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/subscription/insights
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Facts specific to this organization, for choosing a plan: `receipt` (what InfraNest did for it in the last 30 days, when it pays), `evidence` (up to two lines from its own history that a bigger plan would have changed; empty while a critical problem is open), `plans` (per plan id: whether everything fits, and if not how many items would lock and the first of them), `forecast` (counts growing steadily toward the current limit, with the weeks left) and `asked` (entitlement keys members asked for in the last 90 days). Worded in `locale` (en, nl, de or fr). Read-only; cached for ten minutes.

  Scope: `billing.read`
}
